abstract: >-
  Zero-Mathlib Lean 4.35.0 six-kernel formalization, zero-dependency Rust core,
  independent Python exact oracle, real-time 3D WebGL2 interactive studio, and
  AMS-LaTeX preprint uniting Hantzsche-Wendt group rings, all-prime Type-II
  fracton stabilizer codes, and 3D non-Hermitian amoebae with full S4 eigenvalue
  monodromy.
